window.READER_CONTENT["d323d2bdc3a277df0"]={"html": "<h1 id=\"rb来源和授权双时钟原24条件离线核查已完成\">RB来源和授权双时钟：原24条件离线核查已完成</h1>\n<p>先读中央docs27_RB来源还原与授权间隔双时钟分析.md、docs28_上行重传RB预算指针修复与旧数据影响.md。README/analyze为v1原失败，README_v2/analyze_v2为已执行完整修正版，不改这些冻结身份。安全结果evidence/result-02，事后quota细分evidence/quota-detail-01；原始逐轮/逐包/grant-gap仅本地。</p>\n<p>v1/session3818 actual exit1，第9组初始RB还原71超66，原失败8组/源码保留。发现冻结旧C重传只移动局部指针、没扣caller预算；三次均业务前无数据候选，完整范围retx-scope/源代码见docs28。v2/session83845 actual exit0，按旧实际预算语义完整24重算，全部grant保留，不放宽66阈值/不拼旧8；72填充前缀同SHA。verify/session62381 actual exit0：288000包、193133原因、159566轮独立while逐rank回放、668097唯一grant-gap、641490共同业务窗PF观察间隔，151输入身份保持。</p>\n<p>各自慢40的直接检查受影响包均0；原1184/1440、新1095/1440都是轮末未访问归类。轮末包-轮成员9835/8024，其中8751/7221仅数值RB&lt;5且UEquota仍有，1084/803两者同时不足。事后quota_detail/session18871 exit0，成员守恒；不可当唯一事件/因果时间。间隔墙钟1.976295/1.861033ms与名义标签1.686999/1.602048ms并列，不相减CPU。PF核心观测仅wait_begin到end，不含所有后续观测写入/整机处理。</p>\n<p>独立修复树oi-wireless-ran-retx-budget-fix/latency-retx-budget-fix只将C1790改为*n_rb_sched-=rbSize，旧红2/新五夹具0与真实C单元编译0（session96797）；未链接新gNB、未新RAN/时延。后续新无线必须先在该修复树完整构建新gNB/UE/模块和完整栈先导，再建同程序对照，不能将旧72改标签为新版本。2/4Mbps全trace、更早各阶段触发普查、直接RB子分支与新优化干预仍未完成。Office未同步。</p>\n<p>32本地必要原文SHA/可读，actual条款、<a class=\"citation\" href=\"#/paper/P01\" title=\"打开本地论文\">P01</a>/<a class=\"citation\" href=\"#/paper/book\" title=\"打开本地教材\">教材</a>页序sources01/02及docs27/28；用户授权版本不称官网最高，缺新必要原文立即全研究停并由用户补，不下载。原始RAN、原活动C/ELF、原核心不改，无新核心/gNB/UE进程。不要重启/覆盖既有root。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已执行命令\">已执行命令</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cd /home/lbh/oiwireless/oi-wireless-ran-probe-residual\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/probe-rb-gap/analyze_v2.py --self-test\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/probe-rb-gap/analyze_v2.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-load-20261029/main-02 --earlier /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-load-earlier-grants-20261030/result-01 --tail research/latency-analysis/probe-load-tail/evidence/result-01 --cost research/latency-analysis/probe-load-results/cost-evidence/main-02 --sources /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/sources-01.json --output /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/result-02\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/probe-rb-gap/verify.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-load-20261029/main-02 --data /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/result-02 --earlier /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-load-earlier-grants-20261030/result-01 --tail research/latency-analysis/probe-load-tail/evidence/result-01 --method /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/method-identity-02.json --output /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/result-02/independent.json\ntaskset -c 2 /usr/bin/python3 -B research/latency-analysis/probe-rb-gap/quota_detail.py --root /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-load-20261029/main-02 --data /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/result-02 --tail research/latency-analysis/probe-load-tail/evidence/result-01 --output /home/lbh/oiwireless/analysis-source-audit/probe-rb-gap-20261030/quota-detail-01\n</code></pre>\n<p>所有已有输出禁止覆盖；实际失败命令/范围/验证CHG350/TEST497。C修复CHG351/TEST498在修复树与主说明树，完整C命令见docs28/修复树README。Git仅安全汇总/身份/代码/说明，原文/Office/逐包大日志/对象不上传；最终同步以HEAD/远程与本地git-sync-final-01.json为准。</p>\n", "toc": [{"id": "rb来源和授权双时钟原24条件离线核查已完成", "title": "RB来源和授权双时钟：原24条件离线核查已完成", "level": 1}, {"id": "已执行命令", "title": "已执行命令", "level": 2}]};